[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16201.51, "timestamp": "04:30:01", "text": "连Jocknik的标志都印上了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16203.83, "timestamp": "04:30:03", "text": "我当时在考虑拓展人脉并尝试一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16206.309, "timestamp": "04:30:06", "text": "争取一个位置等等。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16208.67, "timestamp": "04:30:08", "text": "做不到。是的，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16211.564, "timestamp": "04:30:11", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u were twerking??"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16213.101, "timestamp": "04:30:13", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmooo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16213.51, "timestamp": "04:30:13", "text": "是的，他爸爸当时也在场。穷人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16216.389, "timestamp": "04:30:16", "text": "他可怜的爸爸只能坐在车里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16221.99, "timestamp": "04:30:21", "text": "就像等了一整夜，直到"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16223.649, "timestamp": "04:30:23", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "his dad was supplying drugs?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16225.389, "timestamp": "04:30:25", "text": "他午饭连东西都没吃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16229.59, "timestamp": "04:30:29", "text": "也。我感到很难过。我们提前到达了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16233.349, "timestamp": "04:30:33", "text": "虽然场地很烂，但什么都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16236.429, "timestamp": "04:30:36", "text": "什么都没开始。我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16240.71, "timestamp": "04:30:40", "text": "兄弟，什么都没发生。我们说，我们来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16244.229, "timestamp": "04:30:44", "text": "4 当时那里一个人也没有，还有一些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16249.189, "timestamp": "04:30:49", "text": "我们当时在抽大麻之类的东西，呃，就像年轻人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16252.149, "timestamp": "04:30:52", "text": "电路就像学位或大学一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16254.389, "timestamp": "04:30:54", "text": "我们是大学学生，我当时也在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16258.11, "timestamp": "04:30:58", "text": "大概是当时的第十名左右吧"}]